Usage: ruralz bundle diff FROM TO [FLAGS]

Compare FROM with TO.

Arguments:
  FROM  Bundle directory, file, saved dump or admin URL
  TO    Same forms as FROM

Flags:
  --admin-token-file PATH  Operator admin token file
  --ca-file PATH           Extra trust anchors (PEM)
  --client-cert PATH       Client certificate for admin mTLS
  --client-key PATH        Key of --client-cert
  --env NAME               Environment to render with (needs --environments)
  --environments FILE      Local Environment resources
  --from-env NAME          Environment of FROM
  --help                   Print this help
  --output text|json       Output format (text or json, default text)
  --to-env NAME            Environment of TO
